WEBVTT

00:01:54.933 --> 00:02:00.594
to figure out how to sort of,
carve out my own niche in the food world.

00:02:01.237 --> 00:02:02.834
AG: I do appreciate your interest

00:02:02.858 --> 00:02:05.755
and this has been refreshingly bad.

00:02:05.779 --> 00:02:06.952
DC: (Laughs)

00:02:06.976 --> 00:02:09.234
Well, Adam, truth be told,

00:02:09.258 --> 00:02:12.637
this wouldn't be the first time
I'd been denied or rejected.

00:02:12.661 --> 00:02:15.606
And I'm completely cool
with being rejected,

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:18.331
because I'll find a way
to be on this podcast

00:02:18.355 --> 00:02:20.584
somehow, some way, one day.

00:02:20.608 --> 00:02:23.962
(Music)

00:02:23.986 --> 00:02:25.880
AG: Well, his day finally came.

00:02:26.255 --> 00:02:27.588
I should probably tell you,

00:02:27.612 --> 00:02:29.270
this is celebrity chef Dave Chang,

00:02:29.294 --> 00:02:31.093
the founder of Momofuku group.